(Country profile: Vanir) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P1] Vanir is the largest rice exporter in the region and a significant wheat) Tj
T*
(producer. Its economy is more agricultural than those of the eastern industrial) Tj
T*
(states, though it also has food processing and light manufacturing.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] The country's main exports are rice and wheat. It imports fuel and) Tj
T*
(fertiliser, both of which are important for its farming sector. Vanir Rice Port) Tj
T*
(is the main export facility, with bulk handling and bagging lines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P3] Rune Trading, a grain and rice trader, is the best-known firm in the) Tj
T*
(sector. The country has a long coastline and several smaller loading points, but) Tj
T*
(Vanir Rice Port handles the largest share of its rice shipments.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P4] Rice is grown in the wet lowlands, while wheat is more common on higher) Tj
T*
(ground. The port has storage silos and bagging lines, and a rail spur connects) Tj
T*
(it to the main inland towns.) Tj
